The build uses the Rust standard library only. It contains no third-party crate.

Vendored data files:

- tests/data/jsontestsuite/*.json: the test_parsing files of JSONTestSuite
  (https://github.com/nst/JSONTestSuite, commit 1ef36fa01286573e846ac449e8683f8833c5b26a).
  Copyright (c) 2016 Nicolas Seriot. MIT License, full text in tests/data/jsontestsuite/LICENSE.
- crates/types/data/noreturn_elf.txt: the ELF list of functions that do not return
  (Ghidra/Features/Base/data/ElfFunctionsThatDoNotReturn of Ghidra, https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra, branch master).
  Copyright the Ghidra authors. Apache License, Version 2.0.
- crates/types/data/syscalls_x86_64.txt: the x86-64 syscall numbers and names of the Linux 6.8 uapi
  header asm/unistd_64.h, recorded as interface facts with no header text. Apache License, Version 2.0, as a part of ghidorah.

docs/licenses.md lists each vendored data file with its source and license.
